# Poison the Waters, second mode, aimed at Bot2: its hand is revealed, Bot1 chooses an artifact or creature card from it (the Memnite, an
# artifact creature; the Lightning Bolt and the Islands cannot be chosen), and that player discards that card. Bot2 keeps the other six.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Poison the Waters
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Island x19

